{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "6477036cc6dbfee9405af04c61ae77221740c0e1e6f0bb0bac38dcffc9d88e03", "ja": "恥じらいの先に", "zh": "羞涩的前方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e5a2b7ebd3f3d4f7e7473d7f308f820e849fccc9551564c2d57868a59f38c007", "ja": "セクシーな表現に悩むメンバー達。亜利沙は\n特別講師として、あずさを連れてくる。話を\n聞くうちに、ふと亜利沙は、セクシーの真髄\nを得る。ファンのため、自分の殻を破ること\nを決意するのだった。", "zh": "为性感的表现形式而烦恼的成员们。亚利沙\n带来了特别讲师梓。在听她讲述的过程中，\n亚利沙突然领悟了性感的真谛。为了粉丝，\n她决心突破自我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4db91f5244b95c7bb9b1188ae9a1915bcc668e4a8ec461271f50cea2b3f05887", "ja": "（天体公演に向けて、『スコーピオ』の4人の\nレッスンは順調に進んでいる）", "zh": "（面向天体公演，《天蝎座》的4人课程进展顺利。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2f5fbf4a19836a941ad56e7dc3c68f93dc57e92e2d9f78772118aaf8eddcc5b6", "ja": "（けどみんなは、新曲の表現にまだ悩んでいるようだ。\n何か協力したいけど、その前に……）", "zh": "（不过，大家似乎还在为如何表现新歌而苦恼。虽然想帮点忙，但在那之前……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "b5238dcc3d94b294ec9c9e9eaddd2d514658e3acf94b2dd3bcd05f983f24f995", "ja": "あの～、{$P$}さん？\nどうしてありさだけ、居残りなんでしょうか……？", "zh": "那个～，{$P$}先生？\n为什么只有亚利沙要留下来呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "90d1771794cf492979c3159e696bdaab9f936c914cb2052e92cc40b5bc19a2e1", "ja": "亜利沙が他のユニットの練習を覗き見してたからだ。\n視線がうるさくて集中できないって苦情があった。", "zh": "因为亚利沙偷看了其他组合的练习。有人投诉说她的视线太烦人，让人没法集中精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "0a0e85b33efa270b7b737bff847cbef379f6db97bc75ce37d1942348b3e4acc5", "ja": "えーっ！　ありさはその、ほんのちょっぴり、\nうっすらと！　覗き見をしていただけですよ！？", "zh": "诶——！人家只是、稍微有那么一点点，\n偷偷瞄了几眼而已嘛！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "9b74e6125b44569b1ecfed3f1f2bc165664a70aa339e52e5e5e5a4b88247b358", "ja": "ありさもレッスン中だったので、シャッターチャンスを\n前にカメラを手に取ることもできず……くっ！", "zh": "亚利沙当时也在上课，面对绝佳的快门机会\n却连相机都拿不了……呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cf3caeb460981d801204ffe79b4e6f690cd39852c8015d75e7ddabce48d77f83", "ja": "うん、未遂で終わってよかったよ。とにかく、\nレッスン中はあんまりみんなをジロジロ見ないこと！", "zh": "嗯，幸好最后未遂。总之，\n练习期间别总是盯着大家看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "656bc2042949a313ae786220f4a38b43039acfb56e30b207d1cc1d47209c39e4", "ja": "まだレッスン中のみんなもいるからな。亜利沙には\nその間、資料室の片付けを手伝ってもらうことにした！", "zh": "毕竟还有大家在练习呢。所以我决定\n趁这期间让亚利沙来资料室帮忙收拾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "ba0776803f5bfbcaa3e9e11369393f828a0090631fcdaf7d7ee6d528a9fc5de0", "ja": "ううっ！　隔離とは、なかなかやりますね\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "呜呜！居然用隔离这招，真有两下子呢\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "483e997a5de0b56588ae033ee463d8c08f731e19378593c8f20afa176b8d9201", "ja": "……あれ？　{$P$}さん、\nそのダンボールに入ってるの、何ですか？", "zh": "……咦？{$P$}先生，装在那个纸箱里的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0c413c68b61c24b8d7be7f7fafc767f587b7b3b6bf3530a23e75c14404b9fad6", "ja": "ああ、これは以前の公演で使った宣伝用の物だよ。\nこの片付けを手伝ってもらおうと思って。", "zh": "啊，这些是之前公演用过的宣传物品。\n我想请你帮忙收拾一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "81ed1c6e7e375e69d1f973f70148ee0e09eba3a3c28bee3cf2bb3686aa658f6b", "ja": "どれどれ……ふぉぉ！？　こ、これは……\nこれはもしかして、お宝の山なのでは！？", "zh": "我看看……呼哦！？ 这、这是……\n这难道是传说中的宝藏山！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "4ab265b79087552f41725916df1fc8d8ddad780c0c6a51796225744e6ed24c6e", "ja": "このセクシーなポスターは……ハッ！\n{$P$}さん、ありさ閃きました！", "zh": "这张性感海报是……啊！\n{$P$}先生，亚利沙想到啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1014_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "381ea6c2927a845e489c04c0bb2ba5becb71c1e63aaf924636a1d208794d4a43", "ja": "また特別レッスンですか？", "zh": "又是特别训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "f302587319cbe1184ad2d8f2fcea82af5f949ad95b5a55f79723025b2c3fcc3a", "ja": "うん。なんかありりんに考えがあるみたい。", "zh": "嗯。亚利沙好像有什么想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "4928f60f23ffec6a5967efd48759dbd920ffded0cad984d8af1d683db9a57334", "ja": "なんだか、海美ちゃんの時と似てるけど……\n亜利沙、何をするつもりなんだろう？", "zh": "总觉得和海美那次有点像，不过……\n亚利莎究竟打算做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1018_se", "source_sha256": "b7d769a933cc8cb3d4f3dc26614c33cd76e85fd1cebd43fb943338373783a379", "ja": "ガチャガチャ、バタン！", "zh": "嘎啦嘎啦，砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "c7551c25c5785381028ebc59574c362077bdefc82419e7e22575600430d2b621", "ja": "お待たせしました～！　と、いうわけで……\n特別講師の、三浦あずさ先生です！　どうぞっ！", "zh": "让您久等啦～！那么……\n这位就是特别讲师，三浦梓老师！请进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "2963c81eda1b19077b9f9daef159a9f1b17b3683bbd13860e848a8c11220dcf1", "ja": "あらあら。亜利沙ちゃんに言われてきたんだけど、\n先生だなんて……本当に、私でいいのかしら？", "zh": "哎呀呀。是亚利沙叫我来的，可是要我当老师……真的由我来可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "5732803979630b733f72dac6027a4704b9b54bf1c6a6bb6e501696118ccb1e11", "ja": "はい！　実はありさ、見つけちゃったんです。\nあずささんの、クラブミリオン公演のポスターを！", "zh": "是的！其实是亚利沙发现的哦。\n是梓小姐的Club Million公演海报！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "2587e62b52eec91371757dc1a9040b1bed50c7768506309cfb120335294d191a", "ja": "そこで！　今回はあずささんに、ズバリ！\nセクシーについて教えを請おうと思いまして！", "zh": "所以！这次，我想直接向梓小姐请教一下，关于性感的秘诀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "6b1abf5e38c6431605dc75c2c7c68bce3ce18a6056e44bceba5ba94a7683325f", "ja": "なるほど、それであずささんを……。", "zh": "原来如此，所以你就去找梓小姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "08b2ea16e7a15c4aea56befdaaa883c205ca2584208abfe7c3f4496349cd7e9a", "ja": "あのポスター、すごくセクシーだったよね～！\n色っぽくて、目が離せなくなっちゃうっていうか……。", "zh": "那张海报真的超级性感呢～！\n不仅很有女人味，甚至让人移不开目光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "635325ba3307a4fb187f2025e4085dcce46d5db4f24c643ca886c0dc8f97890a", "ja": "うん。{$P$}が求めているのは、\nこういう、あずささんみたいな雰囲気かも……。", "zh": "嗯。{$P$}所追求的，\n说不定就是这种、像梓小姐一样的氛围……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "f76f20106d54bcf569932c3052d45ebd50020b41dd1165e158e54b9d453e7d4e", "ja": "でも、私たちにできるんでしょうか？\nあずささんとは、違うところが多すぎますし……。", "zh": "可是，我们真的能做到吗？\n毕竟我们和梓小姐有太多不同了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "2ccb61d607b520744e23510de4f2637d6296ff4f7b46dae3942aae61d6e9ea9c", "ja": "そうね……でも私も、この曲を歌う時に、\nみんなと似たようなことで悩んでいたのよ。", "zh": "是啊……不过，我在唱这首歌的时候，也曾因为和大家相似的事情而烦恼过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "a3a73098ffb5ec026e97b5ad740cd8b90dc95ea7b250ba9e7231d682ad7a7a01", "ja": "ちゃんと歌いこなせるか自信がなくて……でも、\n{$P$}さんの言葉で吹っ切れたの。", "zh": "我没有信心能把这首歌唱好……但是，听了{$P$}先生的话，我就想通了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "6816a2420e443031a4a3df583dba182e2595f1b3bb9b1637389585475e4d5fc3", "ja": "私の心を、全部さらけだそうって。\n恥ずかしいけど、歌に向き合おう、って……。", "zh": "我要把自己的内心全部展露出来。\n虽然有点害羞，但我想认真面对歌唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "340696b019995be7a5481ffade6b8a62a48845c0bf0cb84a8f4e139d4efebff7", "ja": "心をさらけ出す……。", "zh": "敞开心扉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "5c6465ccb245c20a73d77ae392d780553adb63959341923191cbc4a017fadfe2", "ja": "あずささん、大人です……！", "zh": "あ즈さ小姐，真是个大人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "5b2be16d3dfc8ba2d9eebcf8bf05d65e964d4d81d46e44ea333dcaa1a5fdd9f6", "ja": "あの、あずささん。恥ずかしさは、\nどうやって乗り越えたんですか？", "zh": "那个，梓小姐。您是怎么克服害羞的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "8594273ef6a9df6c600a45b36b26cbdd232c0586153760521269783a2d32afb0", "ja": "あっ……そうだよね！　私もそれ、気になる！", "zh": "啊……对哦！我也很想知道这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1034_010azu", "source_sha256": "43d1420a0a6cb309f127cabcf26585eeaea2e8e98e730da58b0dee99391292c0", "ja": "言葉にするのは難しいんだけど……\nとにかく、必死だった……かしら？", "zh": "要说出来有点难……\n总之，我当时拼尽全力了……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "61f78d694ec01916cbfb45142cad6e7a779def9c9d02c5f7b05a795991631740", "ja": "必死、ですか？　でもあずささんは、堂々としていて、\nそんなふうには見えませんでしたけど……。", "zh": "拼命，是吗？可是梓小姐落落大方，\n完全看不出是那个样子呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "06ca1e0e5639628f9f4c0426d4874172863786b723d3a7504be2d7e8406d0874", "ja": "セクシーなアイドルちゃんたちは堂々としている……\nいえ、風花さんはいつも恥じらってますね。", "zh": "性感的偶像们都很坦然……\n不对，风花小姐总是很害羞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "b83fec6f82462086410fff325d720c8b01a23f714f16ec212945222a1f49dc07", "ja": "けど、風花さんはそれがいい……ふむ……ハッ！？\nあ、ありさ、わかったかもしれません！", "zh": "不过，风花小姐这样也很好……嗯……哈！？\n啊、亚利沙好像明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "7840caa7b1e7cc6df42ba19842c5bf112d1fb6dc3eea4af43372043ceec20ddc", "ja": "亜利沙さん、何がわかったんですか？", "zh": "亚利纱，你明白什么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1039_028ari", "source_sha256": "a35dad9e578bcc1c9c593f3088ab9035b22fec54f7fc4bd03c2535b86cbd0c29", "ja": "本当はみんな、恥じらっているのかもしれません！\nでもそれよりも、アイドルとして……プロとして！", "zh": "其实大家说不定都在害羞呢！\n但比起这个，作为偶像……作为专业人士！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1040_028ari", "source_sha256": "d806714d27b5d4eaf2fc2cd5ca241b2b4dcf4c821d4ae98447af7730caa66b4b", "ja": "セクシーさが求められるお仕事を、やりきろうと\nしているんじゃないか、って思いますっ！", "zh": "我觉得，她们可能是想把这种需要性感魅力的工作彻底完成吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "1edbb1a29ad764c48874d31ec10a1a7a49077d01f59a9ea9846aab4094e8022c", "ja": "そういうことかもしれないな。あの時の\nあずささんは、誰よりも一生懸命だったと思うよ。", "zh": "也许就是这样吧。我觉得那时候的秋月小姐，比任何人都要努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1045_010azu", "source_sha256": "75e4bc7cb25c3c5f708e70724a23328f57f4fcde3aab4ab01d5a736bf705fc13", "ja": "殻を破るのって、とっても勇気がいるわ。\n自分を見せるのって怖いことだもの。でもね……。", "zh": "打破自己的壳，需要非常大的勇气。\n因为展现真实的自己，是一件让人害怕的事。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1046_010azu", "source_sha256": "0953039ceacf3050db98006199d0c7106defdbee3e5afc57c615c2fe26281c12", "ja": "新しい自分の姿を、ファンの人が喜んでくれるなら……\n一歩踏み出してみるのも、悪くないんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "如果崭新的自己能够让粉丝们开心的话……\n勇敢迈出一步，感觉也挺不错的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1047_029umi", "source_sha256": "bd8a0fe2275ee4d38c79074b9ef4d2fa4b90b8484f817e6ea29e13e9d19bb572", "ja": "うん……私、思いっきりやれてなかった！\n恥ずかしいって、どこかブレーキかけてたかも。", "zh": "嗯……我之前没能尽情发挥！可能是因为觉得害羞，不知不觉给自己踩了刹车。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1048_017kth", "source_sha256": "4df42987962c5e90d4d7daf76ffe54f3d8e336544210a194e9278536ebf41e73", "ja": "ありがとうございます、あずささん。\nまだ怖い気持ちはありますけど、私も挑戦してみます！", "zh": "谢谢你，梓姐。  \n虽然还是有点害怕，但我也会试着挑战一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1049_028ari", "source_sha256": "46ee721251324525ddff866e95eb7eaf8952f688f57c4fb471b5c27e031e1b5f", "ja": "ありさも、まだちょっと恥ずかしいですケド……。\nでも、がんばってみようと思います！", "zh": "亚利沙虽然也还是觉得有点难为情……\n但是，我打算努力试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1050_010azu", "source_sha256": "efa28ef53b5551d5612c2b1b40c1173ec024dd500d05852b59e5f9979933e258", "ja": "ええ。がんばってね、みんな！", "zh": "嗯。大家，加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1051_033sih", "source_sha256": "5ce51f2be3b7f7beb8c2cf3dfe56e572aa5f0bb9b87761b755e967d92d42233c", "ja": "思いきって、自分をみせる……。", "zh": "下定决心，展现自己……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_04_1052_017kth", "source_sha256": "be3ca9f834a55d08c2588b0de1345d64315fba32ed9421dfb8a53ee42afb471f", "ja": "志保ちゃん……？", "zh": "志保……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
